<title>USA: Oil-Dri Corp of America Q3 April 30 net up.</title>
<headline>Oil-Dri Corp of America Q3 April 30 net up.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third Quarter Ended April 30,</p>
<p>			   1997			1996</p>
<p> Net Sales	  $36,002,060	     $36,427,141</p>
<p> Gross Profit	10,064,475		11,152,603</p>
<p> Operating Income   2,017,151		 1,194,607</p>
<p> Net Income	   1,164,187		   669,922</p>
<p>Average Shares</p>
<p>   Outstanding	6,582,374		 6,803,484</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share    0.18			0.10</p>
<p>			 Nine Months Ended April 30,</p>
<p>			    1997			 1996</p>
<p> Net Sales	 $119,319,414	    $117,531,387</p>
<p> Gross Profit	35,991,208		35,134,004</p>
<p> Operating Income   8,619,258		 4,330,844</p>
<p> Net Income	   5,358,233		 2,559,996</p>
<p>Average Shares</p>
<p>   Outstanding	6,644,428		 6,818,940</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share    0.81			0.38</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month 1996 results after charge of $921,000 or $0.10 a share after tax for cost of settlement and legal feels related to patent litigation.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
